  {
    "id": 2005006010090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……っていうのは半分嘘で、半分本気なんですケド",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "この後アンティーカ５人でレッスンなので、\r\nみんなが揃うまでこうして待ってるんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……まぁ、そろそろ飽きてきたのでー\r\n何かおもしろい話でもしてくださぁい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……！\r\nえーと……そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ！\r\n最近、駅から事務所までの近道を見つけたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "通勤時間がかなり短縮されて、助かってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "近道ですかぁ……いいですねー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "私も今度、使ってみようかなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ……！\r\nまず、駅を出て最初にある坂道を──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……あ、そうだぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "アイドルも近道ができたら良いですよねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ちゃちゃっと『W.I.N.G.』に優勝してー\r\nぱーっとすごいアイドルになってー……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それで……完ー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー\r\n私、めんどーなことは嫌いなんで──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ちょっと待て\r\nアイドルにそんなものはないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……えー……プロデューサーもさっきは\r\n近道が良いって言ってたじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がさっき言ってたのは、物理的なもので……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それに、時間を無駄にするのは感心しないーって",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、それとこれとは話が違う……！",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………摩美々は",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はとにかく、努力をするべきなんだ\r\nそもそも、アイドルっていうのは一朝一夕には──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……その話のオチ、\r\n苦労は買ってでもーとかですよねー？",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まぁ、そう……なるが……\r\nだけどな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005006010220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "──あ、みんな揃ったみたいなんでー\r\nレッスン、行ってきまぁす",
    "charAnim1": "play",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500601/2005006010220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
